<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>iOS UIKit Course</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/</link><description>Recent content on iOS UIKit Course</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="/docs/7.-notification-center/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>7.1. App 7</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.1.-app-7/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.1.-app-7/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="71-app-7"&gt;7.1. App 7&lt;a class="anchor" href="#71-app-7"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will build the following app in this module.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="../.gitbook/assets/app7.1.1.1.gif" alt=""&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The first screen contains a button to fetch text from the second screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If the user taps the button, it takes the user to the second screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The second screen contains a TextField where a user can put some text. This screen also contains a button.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If the user puts some text and taps the button, it returns to the first screen, and the user will see the text on the first screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;So, we have to send the text back to the first screen from the second screen. We will use the Notification Center to do that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The first screen will observe the text, and the second screen will post updates to the text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="creating-a-new-app-app7"&gt;Creating a new app, App7&lt;a class="anchor" href="#creating-a-new-app-app7"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let&amp;rsquo;s create a new app in Xcode and name it &amp;lsquo;App7.&amp;rsquo; Add the views and controllers of two screens:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>7.1. Add an Observer</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.1.-add-an-observer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.1.-add-an-observer/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="71-add-an-observer"&gt;7.1. Add an Observer&lt;a class="anchor" href="#71-add-an-observer"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are sending data from the second screen to the first screen. So, we need to observe the Notification Center for any notifications sent from the Second Screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="initializing-the-notification-center"&gt;Initializing the Notification Center&lt;a class="anchor" href="#initializing-the-notification-center"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We initialize the notification center in the first screen by adding the following line of code in ViewController.swift:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// ViewController.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// App7&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 5/22/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ViewController&lt;/span&gt;: UIViewController {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; firstScreen = FirstScreenView()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; instantiating the Notification center...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; notificationCenter = NotificationCenter.&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;{% endcode %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>7.2. Posting Data to Notification Center</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.2.-posting-data-to-notification-center/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.2.-posting-data-to-notification-center/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="72-posting-data-to-notification-center"&gt;7.2. Posting Data to Notification Center&lt;a class="anchor" href="#72-posting-data-to-notification-center"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let&amp;rsquo;s open up the SecondScreenViewController.swift file. We need to initialize the Notification Center here as well. Let&amp;rsquo;s add the following code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% code lineNumbers=&amp;ldquo;true&amp;rdquo; %}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// SecondScreenViewController.swift&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// App7&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Created by Sakib Miazi on 5/22/23.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;UIKit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;SecondScreenViewController&lt;/span&gt;: UIViewController {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;MARK:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt; instantiating the Notification center...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; notificationCenter = NotificationCenter.&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;//codes omitted...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;{% endcode %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>7.3. Defining the names (identifiers) of the Notifications in a Better Way</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.3.-defining-the-names-identifiers-of-the-notifications-in-a-better-way/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.3.-defining-the-names-identifiers-of-the-notifications-in-a-better-way/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="73-defining-the-names-identifiers-of-the-notifications-in-a-better-way"&gt;7.3. Defining the names (identifiers) of the Notifications in a Better Way&lt;a class="anchor" href="#73-defining-the-names-identifiers-of-the-notifications-in-a-better-way"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In real life, the Notification Center is used very frequently, especially when we fetch data from the internet and wait for data to update. Oftentimes, it&amp;rsquo;s pretty common to create tens of observers in a single app. So, just writing the names/identifiers of the notifications, as we did before, is not a good way of dealing with it. If the names do not match on both sides, notifications won&amp;rsquo;t work. So, keeping the names in a separate class as static variables is better.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>7.4. Reference Code</title><link>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.4.-reference-code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/docs/7.-notification-center/7.4.-reference-code/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="74-reference-code"&gt;7.4. Reference Code&lt;a class="anchor" href="#74-reference-code"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{% file src=&amp;quot;../.gitbook/assets/App7 (1).zip&amp;quot; %}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>